      "translation": "此 <a href=\"RedisSerializer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>serializer</code></a> 可通过自定义 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/ClassLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>ClassLoader</code></a> 或自定义\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>converters</code></a> 进行构建。",
